      "title": "Using States and Actions: Recap",
      "content": [
        {
          "block_id": "BLOCK008",
          "type": "list",
          "introduction": "Remember:",
          "list_style": "bulleted",
          "items": [
            "Stative verbs usually stay simple: I know, I need.",
            "Have, think and see can be states or activities.",
            "Only the activity meaning takes -ing.",
            "Decide the meaning first."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "key_takeaway": "Check the meaning before adding -ing.",
